From 91a4fcea50d616bac26a1c9137581c5c2826aea7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Larsson <who+github@cnackers.org>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:15:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tsskey: replace asn1crypto with the ASN.1 parser in
 cryptography

The latest release of cryptography have an ASN.1 parser so we can
drop a dependency.

Due to have tpm2-openssl and tpm2-tss-engine have encoded booleans
we need to workaround how the empty_auth field is decoded.

Also implement PEM encoding/decoding as we used asn1crypto for that.

Signed-off-by: Erik Larsson <who+github@cnackers.org>
